 "nl": [
  "Hosts in nvr may reach cameras over SMTP (TCP 25) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "Allow backup to connect to ntp-servers using LDAP (TCP 389).",
  "nvr must never reach student-lab, regardless of any other rule.",
  "Hosts in ntp-servers may reach engineering over HTTPS (TCP 443) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Hosts in hr may reach scada over SMB (TCP 445) and syslog (UDP 514) and DNS over UDP 53.",
  "Hosts in nvr may reach backup over HTTPS (TCP 443) and SMTP (TCP 25) and SMB (TCP 445).",
  "scada offers DNS over UDP 53 to every zone.",
  "Allow cameras to connect to engineering using syslog (UDP 514) and HTTP (TCP 80).",
  "nvr may use any TCP port towards ntp-servers, except RDP (TCP 3389), FTP (TCP 21), which must be blocked.",
  "scada may use any UDP port towards student-lab, except TFTP (UDP 69), which must be blocked.",
  "Allow student-lab to connect to hr using IMAP (TCP 143) and SNMP (UDP 161).",
  "Allow scada to connect to printers using LDAP (TCP 389) and MySQL (TCP 3306).",
  "Restrict backup so that its only permitted destinations are engineering on DNS over UDP 53; drop all other traffic it originates.",
  "scada is isolated: it may only reach student-lab on HTTPS (TCP 443), and nothing else.",
  "ntp-servers offers HTTP (TCP 80) and HTTPS (TCP 443) to every zone."
 ],
